WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.950
One verse of the Qur'an traces
both sexes back to a single soul.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:08.330
In the Qur'an, Adam and
his wife both disobey,

3
00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:10.550
and both repent together.

4
00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:15.840
One Qur'an verse promises believing men
and women the same forgiveness and reward.

5
00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.270
Another gives a son twice
the share of a daughter.

6
00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:22.530
Equal before God, yet different in law?

7
00:00:22.580 --> 00:00:26.360
What does Islam teach about
men, women and the family?

8
00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:30.380
In this mission, you'll read what the
Qur'an and the Hadith say about men and

9
00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.300
women.

10
00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:36.900
Then you'll weigh up a hard question:
are women and men equal in Islam?

11
00:00:36.950 --> 00:00:40.430
Your mission: find out what
Islam teaches about men,

12
00:00:40.480 --> 00:00:41.870
women and the family.
